  "id": "f0b000b0-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "name": "Player/TakeDamage",
  "description": "Standard hit response: gates on i-frame timer (no double damage). DECs playerHealth, sets i-frame timer to 60 frames (~1 sec), resets strobe tick, knocks player back 3 tiles, and updates the Healthbar via Player/UpdateHealthbar. The Healthbar actor monitors var_21 (iframeTimer) per-frame and toggles player visibility for the strobe + auto-restores when timer expires.",
